      "description": "As a\n Developer and QA,\nI want\n a representative set of sample products extracted from Magento and loaded into lower environments,\nso that\n subsequent components can be built and tested without waiting for the MuleSoft/AP21 integration to be available.\nSample products must be imported into the lower environment SFCC instances and cover enough variation to represent the product hierarchy and category model. Magento is the interim data source — AP21 is not currently accessible. Once the MuleSoft/AP21 integration is available, this sample data will be replaced by the live feed.\nData should be exported from Magento and transformed into SFCC-compatible import format, covering:\nAt least one product per top-level category\nProducts with multiple colours and sizes to exercise the master → variation group → variant hierarchy\nA mix of in-stock and out-of-stock variants",
