      "id": "18363",
      "key": "SFCC-197",
      "summary": "Product Image Management",
      "description": "As a\n Merchandiser,\\n\\n\nI want\n product images to be stored and managed centrally within SFCC,\\n\\n\nso that\n the storefront can reliably display optimised product imagery across all pages and breakpoints.\\n\\n---\\n\\nProduct images are uploaded and managed in SFCC BM at the master or variation group (colour) level. Images are served at appropriate resolutions per device breakpoint from a single uploaded source asset. A configurable background colour or treatment per page type is supported without requiring separate asset uploads per context (PRD-069).\\n\\nThe priority/hero image per product is configurable and may vary per product. Video content is out of scope — see SFCC-188.",
