    {
      "id": "17843",
      "key": "SFCC-17",
      "summary": "Credit Notes & Gift Cards",
      "description": "Epic Name:\n Credit Notes & Gift Cards\nEpic Summary\nThis epic covers the purchase of physical and digital gift cards, their display in cart and checkout, redemption of gift cards and credit notes at checkout via GiveX, and balance checking in My Account. Gift cards and credit notes are treated identically at redemption — both use the same card number and PIN mechanism via GiveX. This epic is in scope for all domestic storefronts (AU, UK, EU domestic, US domestic); redemption on Global-e international storefronts is not in scope.\nBusiness Value / Objective\nGift cards are both a revenue stream and a customer acquisition tool for Zimmermann. Credit notes are a key part of the returns and CS experience. Ensuring both work seamlessly at checkout — including split payment combinations with cards, PayPal, and Retail Rewards — is essential for go-live.\nScope\nIn Scope:\nPhysical and digital gift card PDP (amount selection, recipient details, delivery date picker)\nGift card display in mini-cart and full cart with edit, remove, and move-to-wishlist actions\nCheckout flow variations for digital-only, physical-only, and mixed carts (including Collect in Boutique suppression rules)\nGift card redemption at checkout: card number and PIN entry, GiveX real-time validation, balance application\nCredit note redemption at checkout using identical mechanism to gift cards\nSplit payment — gift card/credit note combined with credit card, PayPal, Apple Pay, Retail Rewards, or promotional codes\nMultiple gift cards and credit notes combinable in a single transaction\nBalance check in My Account (card number entry, real-time GiveX lookup, balance and expiry display)\nGift card payment method suppressed when a gift card product is in cart\nOrder confirmation via Narvar (domestic) and Global-e (international)\nOut of Scope:\nGift card and credit note redemption on EU international, HK, ME, US international — not supported at go-live (future roadmap)\nGiveX platform configuration — Zimmermann scope\nGift card email templates — Zimmermann scope\nDependencies\nGiveX — real-time gift card and credit note validation and redemption via MuleSoft\nAssumptions & Constraints\nGift cards and credit notes are treated identically at checkout — same entry mechanism, same GiveX integration\nGift card redemption is not available on Global-e international storefronts (EU intl, HK, ME, US intl)\nIf GiveX is unavailable at checkout, gift card and credit note payment is blocked; the customer must use an alternative payment method\nMaximum number of gift cards/credit notes per transaction to be confirmed by Zimmermann",
