    {
      "id": "17844",
      "key": "SFCC-18",
      "summary": "Pricing",
      "description": "Epic Name:\n Pricing\nEpic Summary\nThis epic covers the full pricing model in SFCC — price feed ingestion from AP21, pricebook configuration per storefront and currency, sale and markdown pricing, VIC customer group pricing, and multi-currency support including FX conversion and Global-e nightly pricing.\nBusiness Value / Objective\nPricing is foundational to every part of the storefront. Accurate pricebook ingestion from AP21, correct currency display across 8 storefronts, and VIC customer group pricing are all prerequisites for go-live. Getting the Global-e FX pricing job right is equally critical for Zimmermann's international revenue.\nScope\nIn Scope:\nPrice feed ingestion from AP21 via MuleSoft (full and delta, base RRP and fixed pricelists per Global-e market)\nPricebook configuration per storefront and currency in BM\nFuture-dated markdown pricing activation via MuleSoft\nSale/markdown pricing display (was/now) across PLP, PDP, mini-cart, cart, wishlist, checkout, and order history\nFinal sale flagging (final_sale and is_returnable attributes)\nVIC and customer group catalogue pricing (Gold VIC 10% off full price, Platinum VIC, PR/investors, Advent)\nMulti-currency support — country-to-currency mapping, FX conversion approaches (base RRP, fixed pricelist, fixed FX, dynamic FX), rounding rules\nNightly Global-e FX pricing job — load FX rates, coefficients, generate pricebooks\nDDP/DDU messaging per country on PDP, mini-cart, cart, and checkout\nTax display configuration (GST/VAT inclusive for AU/EU, exclusive for US) and tax class bulk assignment\nBM currency configuration interface (conversion approach, FX rate display, country-currency mapping)\nFX rate lock for refunds\nDaily Global-e catalogue feed (SFTP export for VAT rates and HS code assignments)\nOut of Scope:\nPromotions engine and coupon codes — covered in SFCC-87 (Promotions)\nAvalara tax calculation — covered in SFCC-12 (Checkout Flow & Delivery)\nRetail Rewards redemption at checkout — covered in SFCC-13 (Payments)\nGift card redemption at checkout — covered in SFCC-17 (Credit Notes & Gift Cards)\nCart handoff to Global-e — covered in SFCC-12 (Checkout Flow & Delivery)\nGlobal-e checkout experience — Global-e scope\nDependencies\nAP21 via MuleSoft — price feed (full and delta), base RRP pricebooks, fixed pricelists per Global-e market\nGlobal-e — nightly FX feed and FX rate coefficients for international pricebook generation\nAssumptions & Constraints\nAP21 is the source of truth for all product pricing; SFCC receives and stores prices via MuleSoft — no manual price entry in SFCC\nCustomer group discounts (VIC) are catalogue-based only and do not stack with sale pricing\nGlobal-e owns FX rate sourcing for international markets; SFCC runs nightly job to load and apply",
