      "id": "17841",
      "key": "SFCC-15",
      "summary": "Order Management",
      "description": "Epic Name:\n Order Management\nEpic Summary\nThis epic covers order creation and processing in SFCC, inventory feed consumption, and order and shipment status display in My Account. SFCC creates the order record, passes it to NewStore OMS via MuleSoft, and surfaces status back to the customer — all fulfilment, carrier, and dispatch logic is owned downstream by NewStore.\nBusiness Value / Objective\nAccurate order creation, inventory management, and order status visibility are foundational to the post-purchase experience. Getting this right ensures customers have confidence in their orders and reduces CS contact volume across all 8 storefronts.\nScope\nIn Scope:\nOrder record creation in SFCC on successful payment authorisation, including Global-e international order payload receipt\nOrder data export to MuleSoft/NewStore OMS (line items, delivery method, addresses, packaging, promotions, DDP/DDU flags)\nOrder confirmation page (order number, summary, delivery address, delivery method, Narvar EDD)\nOrder history and order detail display in My Account (status sourced from NewStore via MuleSoft)\nTracking link in My Account order detail (Narvar for domestic; Global-e for international)\nBOPIS (Collect in Boutique) order status display in My Account\nInventory feed consumption (full and delta) via MuleSoft from NewStore OMS\nSFS inventory feed for boutique stock inclusion in availability calculation\nStore opening hours feed from Google Business for boutique selector\nOut of Scope:\nBuffer stock configuration — covered in SFCC-11 (Cart)\nNotify Me / back in stock — covered in SFCC-5 (PDP)\nDelivery method display and free shipping thresholds — covered in SFCC-12 (Checkout Flow & Delivery)\nCarrier selection, dispatch, and label generation — NewStore OMS scope\nReturns and refunds — covered in SFCC-14 (Returns & Refunds)\nCheckout flow build — covered in SFCC-12 (Checkout Flow & Delivery)\nDependencies\nMuleSoft/NewStore OMS — order export, inventory feeds, order and shipment status data\nNarvar — EDD display at checkout and tracking link in My Account for domestic orders\nGlobal-e — international order payload ingestion and tracking link\nGoogle Business API — store opening hours feed for boutique selector\nAssumptions & Constraints\nSFCC displays order and shipment status exactly as returned by NewStore via MuleSoft — no derivation logic in SFCC\nNewStore OMS owns all carrier selection, fulfilment routing, and label generation; SFCC passes the selected delivery method only\nShipment-level detail, split shipments, and 3PL tracking numbers are not displayed in SFCC; customers are directed to Narvar or Global-e for detailed tracking",
