      "value": "1. Overview\n-----------\n\nThe order domain covers three distinct flows in the Zimmermann SFCC platform:\n\n| Flow | Direction | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Create Order | SFCC → MuleSoft → NewStore | Customer places order on SFCC; MuleSoft creates it in NewStore OMS |\n| Order History & Details | SFCC → MuleSoft → NewStore | My Account — historic orders, returns, and order detail retrieval |\n| Returns (Store → Narvar) | NewStore → MuleSoft → Narvar | Store return processed; linked to Narvar tracking |\n| Returns (Narvar → 3PL) | Narvar → MuleSoft → 3PL SFTP | Customer-initiated return; MuleSoft routes to 3PL |\n\n---\n\n2. Flow: Create Order\n---------------------\n\n### 2.1 Trigger\n\nA customer completes checkout on SFCC. SFCC calls MuleSoft with the **order ID** only — MuleSoft fetches the full order detail from SFCC.\n\n### 2.2 System Flow\n\nnonewide760Customer places order on SFCC\n│\nSFCC ──[orderId]──► orders-prc-api (Experience API)\n│\nFetch full order from SFCC API\n│\nTransform to NewStore schema\n(see mapping rules below)\n│\nPOST ──► NewStore (create order)\n│\nResponse ──► SFCC (order\\_id + success/fail)\n\n### 2.3 Key Data Mapping Rules\n\n| Rule | Logic |\n| --- | --- |\n| Item quantity | SFCC qty > 1 split into individual line items (NewStore has no qty field) |\n| 0-value orders (rewards) | Payment array → blank; shipping discount applied at item level |\n| Price | From `extension_attributes.price` (SFCC recalculated field) |\n| Tax (no rewards) | `item_tax_amount ÷ quantity` |\n| Tax (with rewards) | `tax_pct × (price − discounts − rewards)` |\n| Discount | `total_discount ÷ quantity` |\n| Rewards split | `((item_price − item_discount) × total_rewards) ÷ (subtotal + order_discount)` |\n| Rounding | Discrepancies adjusted on last item; final reconciliation on last product's price |\n| Reward application order | Apply to items first, then to shipping |\n\n### 2.4 SFCC Cartridge Touchpoint\n\n* Custom controller/script in `int_custom_zim_global` calls MuleSoft `orders-prc-api` after order placement\n* Passes `orderId` as query parameter\n* Handles success/failure response and surfaces error to checkout if needed\n\n---\n\n3. Flow: Order History & Details (My Account)\n---------------------------------------------\n\n### 3.1 Trigger\n\nCustomer navigates to My Account in SFCC. SFCC calls MuleSoft to retrieve order data from NewStore.\n\n### 3.2 System Flow\n\nnonewide760SFCC (My Account)\n│\n├──[GET /orders?customer\\_id&offset&count]──► sfcc-exp-api ──► NewStore\n│ │\n│ order summaries\n│\n├──[GET /orders/{order\\_id}?id\\_type=internal]──► sfcc-exp-api ──► NewStore\n│ │\n│ full order + payments + fulfilment\n│\n└──[GET /returns?customer\\_id&offset&count]──► sfcc-exp-api ──► NewStore\n│\nreturn summaries\n\n### 3.3 API Endpoints (SFCC calls these)\n\n| Operation | Dev URL | Method |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Historic Orders | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/magento-exp-api-dev/api/orders?customer_id={id}&offset={n}&count={n}` | GET |\n| Order Details | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/magento-exp-api-dev/api/orders/{order_id}?id_type=internal` | GET |\n| Returns | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/magento-exp-api-dev/api/returns?customer_id={id}&offset={n}&count={n}` | GET |\n\n### 3.4 Response Data Model (from NewStore)\n\n**Order summary fields returned to SFCC:**\n\n| Field | Source |\n| --- | --- |\n| `id` | NewStore order ID (e.g., ZX00000339) |\n| `placed_at` | ISO timestamp |\n| `status` | closed / open / cancelled |\n| `currency` | Site currency (GBP / AUD / USD / EUR) |\n| `fulfillment_type` | in\\_store\\_purchase / ship\\_to\\_address |\n| `items[].product_attributes` | name, size, color, image\\_url |\n| `items[].external_identifier` | sku, ean13 |\n| `items[].extended_attributes` | Collection, Material, Sleeve (display metadata) |\n| `totals` | gross, net, tax, discount, shipping |\n| `payments` | psp, method, amount, status |\n\n---\n\n4. Flow: Returns\n----------------\n\n### 4.1 Store Return → Narvar\n\nnonewide760NewStore (return.processed webhook)\n──► orders-prc-api\n──► Narvar (return linked in tracking portal)\n\n### 4.2 Narvar → 3PL\n\nnonewide760Narvar (return\\_initiated\\_standard event)\n──► orders-prc-api\n──► 3PL SFTP (return label + item data)\n──► Narvar S3 (cache, 60-day retention)\n\n---\n\n5. SFCC Cartridge Touchpoints\n-----------------------------\n\n| Page / Feature | Integration Point |\n| --- | --- |\n| Checkout (order confirmation) | POST to `orders-prc-api` with orderId |\n| My Account → Order History | GET `sfcc-exp-api` /orders |\n| My Account → Order Detail | GET `sfcc-exp-api` /orders/{id} |\n| My Account → Returns | GET `sfcc-exp-api` /returns |\n\nAll calls authenticated via client credentials stored in SFCC custom site preferences or SFCC secrets management. MuleSoft uses Mule secure property placeholder for credentials.\n\n---\n\n6. Error Handling\n-----------------\n\n| HTTP Status | Scenario | SFCC Behaviour |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 200 | Success | Render order data |\n| 400 | Invalid request | Log + surface error message |\n| 401 | Unauthorised | Re-authenticate + retry once |\n| 404 | Order / customer not found | Show empty state in My Account |\n| 500 | MuleSoft internal error | Show generic error; alert via Anypoint |\n\nMuleSoft retries: 3 attempts, 1-minute interval.\n\n---\n\n7. Key Design Decisions\n-----------------------\n\n| Decision | Choice | Rationale |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Order creation trigger | SFCC sends orderId only | Avoids payload size issues; MuleSoft fetches authoritative data |\n| OMS | NewStore | Fulfilment and returns owned by NewStore |\n| Order history source | NewStore (via MuleSoft) | Single source of truth across online + in-store channels |\n| Returns portal | Narvar | Customer-facing return initiation; MuleSoft routes to 3PL |\n\n---\n\n8. Open Items\n-------------\n\n| # | Item | Owner |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Confirm SFCC API endpoint MuleSoft will call to fetch order details | SFCC Dev |\n| 2 | Define auth mechanism for SFCC → MuleSoft calls (bearer token / client credentials) | Integration Lead |\n| 3 | Confirm Narvar 3PL SFTP destination per region (AU / UK / US) | Zimmermann Ops |\n| 4 | Define how SFCC order ID maps to NewStore external\\_order\\_id | Integration Lead |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "page_width": "fixed-width"
  }
}"}

